  "title": "Claude Grades Itself Until It's Perfect",
  "description": "Stop prompting one task at a time. Build a Claude loop: a task plus a measurable goal, so Claude checks its own work and rewrites until it passes. The key most people miss is giving it numbers or a checklist to grade against. \n\nGet the full loop setup here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1z2v3nmFedqH-OUlw1PqAjiu5dG4i0X7eeymkR6c00iA/edit?usp=sharing\n\n #shorts \n\n #claudeai #aiagents",
